260	     * meaningless for a SuperAdmin emergency action — transition() would
261	     * silently no-op on ENDED→ENDED, so we throw IllegalStateTransition before
262	     * delegating. The pre-check runs AFTER the lock inside transition() would
263	     * catch cancelled_at, so cancelled LIVE events still reach transition() and
264	     * surface EventStateLocked from the lock re-check.
